PRACTICE RULES
==================================================

1. Solve one question at a time.
2. Write code independently.
3. Do not copy solutions.
4. Test your code in the browser.
5. Understand the logic behind every method.
6. Move to the next level after understanding the previous level.
7. For projects, plan the UI, data, events and logic before coding.

FINAL GOAL:
Become capable of building complete JavaScript frontend applications independently and connecting them with Python Flask backends.
